# Private memory and imports
#
# NOTE ON ANCHORING: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to THIS directory.
# `memory/store/` matches <root>/memory/store/ ONLY — it does not match
# addons/full-engine/memory/store/, which is where the full-engine code actually
# writes. Every rule protecting a path the code can create is therefore written
# with a leading `**/` so it matches at ANY depth. tests/test_private_paths_ignored.py
# derives the path list from the code's own constants and fails if this drifts.
private-memory/
private-imports/
local-memory/
vector-index/
vector-store/
**/memory/store/
memory/store/
.turbovec/
knowledge-graph/
graphify-out/
**/shared-brain.jsonl
brain/shared-brain.jsonl
**/*.sidecar.json
**/store/*.tvim
central-brain/
**/central-brain/
.project-os-central-brain/
private-screenshots/
private-exports/
raw-exports/

